Description: TI EdgeAI OpenVX demo applications
 OpenVX-based deep learning demonstration applications for TI EdgeAI
 platforms.  Builds on top of edgeai-tiovx-kernels to provide ready-to-run
 inference demos using the OpenVX graph API.
 .
